>>>>    and AES-CCM [RFC6655] apply to this document as well.
>>>>
>>>> NEW
>>>>
>>>>  The security considerations in TLS 1.2 [RFC5246], DTLS 1.2 [RFC6347],
>>>>  ECDHE_PSK [RFC5489], AES-GCM [RFC5288],and AES-CCM [RFC6655] apply
>>>>  to this document as well.
>>>>>
